    \"Gem-Knight\" monsters and you have \"Gem-Knight Fusion\" in your GY.\r\n\u25CF
    Add 1 \"Gem-\" monster from your Deck or banishment to your hand, also any effect
    damage your opponent takes during the Main Phase this turn is halved."
